 "description": "Check US subscription cancellation terms without executing cancellation. Known vendors include review-only and retired scopes: their presence is not automation support. Adobe requires manual contract review. Typeform requires Basic, direct/self-serve platform scope and returns CANCEL_AT_PERIOD_END, not an immediate cancellation or refund. Missing scope, retired sources or unavailable current evidence return UNKNOWN.",
